BT 1 0 0 1 0 86 Tm .433561 Tw 12 TL /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg (On startup, the shell prints a stylised banner showing the name ) Tj /F2 10 Tf (EduMIPS64) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( in heavy block letters, with gold \223Edu\224,) Tj T* 0 Tw .555705 Tw (bright \223MIPS\224 and red \22364\224 matching the colours of the project logo. Each segment fades from a bold bright tone at) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.749705 Tw (the top to a deeper shade at the bottom, which gives the blocks a soft drop-shadow / 3-D effect. The version,) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.046123 Tw (codename and build date appear right below. The banner uses ANSI colours and Unicode block characters, so it) Tj T* 0 Tw .114273 Tw (appears at its best on any modern terminal \(Linux/macOS, Windows Terminal, Codespaces, \205\). When the standard) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.346705 Tw (output is not a TTY, when ) Tj /F4 10 Tf (COLUMNS) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( is too small, or when the encoding is not UTF-8, the banner falls back) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.729672 Tw (automatically to a plain one-line version string, which keeps scripts and pipelines clean. If you do not want the) Tj T* 0 Tw (banner at all, pass ) Tj /F4 10 Tf (--no-banner) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( on the command line.) Tj T* ET
